dotnetdide

Based on the browser Roslyn compilation and assembly-loading approach demonstrated by
WasmSharp (JakeYallop), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/JakeYallop/WasmSharp
Reference commit: 2f8c93bfa39f2068ad932a748ba23f740075327c

This is a .NET-first adaptation, not an unmodified distribution of WasmSharp.
It replaces the TypeScript/Comlink/pnpm packaging with .NET projects, C# tests,
and a small dependency-free JavaScript loader/worker bridge. The persistent
submission chain and System.IO workspace API are implemented in this repository.

.NET and Roslyn are Microsoft/.NET Foundation projects distributed under their
respective licenses. NuGet dependency versions and transitive packages are recorded
in packages.lock.json files.

The testing page bundles Monaco Editor 0.57.0 (Microsoft), licensed under MIT.
Unmodified prebuilt browser assets and license notices are in
src/DotnetDide.Browser/wwwroot/vendor/monaco/. See README.txt there for the
upstream download and verified SHA-512 integrity. Monaco is a playground UI
dependency, not a dependency of the .NET runspace SDK.

Bundled media libraries (explicit package versions are locked):
StbImageSharp 2.30.16 (Unlicense OR MIT), StbImageWriteSharp 1.16.7 (public domain),
NAudio.Core 3.3.0 (MIT), Concentus 2.2.2 (BSD-style license, multiple authors), and
Concentus.Oggfile 1.0.7 (MIT). The package loader also uses NuGet.Frameworks and
NuGet.Versioning 7.9.0 (Apache-2.0). See docs/licenses for upstream notices;
Microsoft System.* dependencies use their respective .NET licenses.
Packages downloaded at runtime have their own licenses and are not part of this
bundled distribution.

ASP.NET Core managed middleware, routing and IServer assemblies are copied from
the pinned SDK's Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 11.0.0-rc.2.26504.105 shared runtime
(Microsoft/.NET Foundation, MIT). build/aspnet.props records the exact assembly
set. Kestrel/native hosting and the full ASP.NET runtime pack are not included.
See docs/licenses/aspnetcore.txt.
